  "description": "The headlight assembly and tail lights combo are compatible with the 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado model. YITAMOTOR products are all thoroughly tested to meet federal and international standards and are fully street legal.\nFitment\nFor 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD\nFor 2003-2004 Chevy Silverado 2500\nFor 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 2500 HD/3500\nFor 2007 Chevy Silverado 1500 Classic /1500 HD Classic /2500 HD Classic /3500 Classic\nFor 2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nBrighter & Wider Lighting\nThis upgraded headlight assembly adopts special meticulous chrome plating to increase the brightness and ultra-wide angle for better visibility in dusky conditions to make your drive safer.\nWeather-Sealed\nThe fully sealed structure improves waterproof rating for effectively preventing moisture from entering the inside of headlights for longer service life.\nTougher-Than-Nails Construction\nHeavy-duty housings are made of superior OEM Grade ABS plastic to ensure exceptional resistance to weather and impact that guarantees durability for years ahead.\nPlug-n-Play Installation\nAs a fully compatible replacement for factory parts, our bolt-on style headlights are designed for quick and easy installation, requiring no modification or drilling.\nDirect Replacement\nProfessional Installation would be highly recommended. No extra gaps after installation for a perfect fit. Comes with a complete set of headlights, including Driver (Left) & Passenger (Right) sides.",
